      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخايروا فِيهِ إِلَى حَكَمٍ</span></b>  <i>They contended together
for superior goodness,</i> or <i>for excellence, in it,</i> or
<i>with respect to it, appealing to a judge,</i> or <i>an
arbiter.</i> (A.)

